  (text "AZERO = AA | BB | CC1 & ACCLR | CC2 & ACCLR | CC3 & G2CLA | EE | FF\nASEL_0 (PCTR,MADR) = HH | JJ | LL\nASEL_1 (efad,MADR) = HH | JJ | MM\nBZERO = AA | CC3 & ~G2OSR | HH | JJ | KK | LL | MM | NN\nBSEL_0 (INBUS) = BB | CC\nCIN = FF | JJ | NN & MBUF_0\nQSEL_0 (AND) = PP1\nQSEL_1 (ADD) = FF | JJ | NN | PP2"
